  "text": "Premier Specialty & Emergency Veterinary Hospital | Scarborough, ME\nClose\nPRESCRIPTION REQUEST\n\n207-885-1290\n\nreception@mvmc.vet\n\n\n\n207-885-1290\n\nreception@mvmc.vet\n\n\nEvents\nBlog\nHome\nAbout Us\nAbout Us\nTeam\nReviews\nVETERINARY INTERNSHIPS/EXTERNSHIPS\nOur Services\nSpecialty\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nClinical Trials\nSurgery\nRehabilitation & Sports Medicine\nCardiology\nRadiology\nOphthalmology\nPharmacy\nEmergency & Critical Care\nUrgent Care\nWhat to Expect\nDVM Referrals\nPet Loss Support\nResources\nPayment Options\nInformational Videos\nFeeding Tubes\nEye Drops\nPassive Range of Motion\nMedicating Cats\nTPLO Postop Care\nClosed Suction Drains\nInsulin Injection\nHelp ‘Em Up Harness & C-Sling\nSubcutaneous Fluid Administration\nForms\nClient Intake Form\nRehab Registration Form\nRehab Consent Form\nInternal Medicine Form\nOncology Medical Form\nBaer Puppy Form\nBrochure Request Form\nFAQs\nAccreditations & Awards\nDiscounted Hotels Rates for Owners\nCareers\nDonate\nContact\nHome\nAbout Us\nAbout Us\nTeam\nReviews\nVETERINARY INTERNSHIPS/EXTERNSHIPS\nOur Services\nSpecialty\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nClinical Trials\nSurgery\nRehabilitation & Sports Medicine\nCardiology\nRadiology\nOphthalmology\nPharmacy\nEmergency & Critical Care\nUrgent Care\nWhat to Expect\nDVM Referrals\nPet Loss Support\nResources\nPayment Options\nInformational Videos\nFeeding Tubes\nEye Drops\nPassive Range of Motion\nMedicating Cats\nTPLO Postop Care\nClosed Suction Drains\nInsulin Injection\nHelp ‘Em Up Harness & C-Sling\nSubcutaneous Fluid Administration\nForms\nClient Intake Form\nRehab Registration Form\nRehab Consent Form\nInternal Medicine Form\nOncology Medical Form\nBaer Puppy Form\nBrochure Request Form\nFAQs\nAccreditations & Awards\nDiscounted Hotels Rates for Owners\nCareers\nDonate\nContact\nNew Connected Care Model\nSame exceptional care, now with more options\nLearn More\nSpecialty & Emergency\nVeterinary Care\nOpen 24/7\nAdvanced and compassionate care for your pet\nSpecialty Appointment Form\nCall For Emergency 207-885-1290\nIn Partnership with Petmedic\nUrgent Care\nOpen for same-day urgent vet appointments\nBook Now\nWe’ve taken vet care to the\nnext level.\nMaine Veterinary Medical Center\nis proud to have a state-of-the-art facilities and cutting-edge technology,\nour veterinarians\ncan deliver diagnostic services and advanced treatment options for a wide range of conditions.\nRead more\nWe specialize in\nexcellence.\nMaine Vet Medical Center\n, where our Veterinary Technician Specialists stand as pillars of expertise in their perspective fields. With unparalleled dedication, our team ensures top-tier care for your beloved pets, setting the standard for veterinary excellence in Maine.\nComplete Veterinary Care\nAt Maine Veterinary\nMaine Veterinary Medical Center is committed to providing high-quality care for pets of all ages and needs.\nOur veterinary team offers specialized\nveterinary services\nin internal medicine, neurology, oncology,\nophthalmology,\nsurgery, sports medicine and rehabilitation, emergency and critical care, and cardiology.\nVeterinary Surgery\nThe surgical department at\nMVMC\nis dedicated to providing excellence in small animals…\nRead more\nVeterinary Cardiology\nOur cardiology team is dedicated to diagnosing, managing, and treating disorders of the heart and cardiovascular systems.\nRead more\nVeterinary Neurology\nThe neurology department at MVMC specializes in the treatment of neurological.…\nRead more\nView All Services\nWe are on your side.\nMeet our veterinary team.\nThe veterinary team at\nMaine Veterinary Medical Center\nconsists of highly trained and knowledgeable problem solvers. Our professional staff members and technicians who work alongside our board-certified\nveterinarians\nare lifelong animal lovers on a mission to enhance pet quality of life.\nMeet The Team\nKind words from\nclients.\n“Dr. Gill and her team were truly wonderful during the time my dog, Leo, was a patient at MVMC. They showed incredible patience in answering all of my questions (sometimes multiple phone calls a day) as well as in taking the time to carefully explain each new treatment/medication/whatever came up throughout the process. I will be forever grateful for the amazing care that Leo received.”\nEmily R.\n“The doctors, technicians, and staff here are wonderful. We have been for multiple reasons (PT, acupuncture, emergency services), and every single person has been kind, understanding, knowledgeable, and professional. I appreciate that they are very willing to take the time to explain treatment and cost options to figure out what works best for our needs.”\nAimee H.\nRead All Reviews\nAnimal Poison Control Center\nAnimal Poison Control Center\n\nRequest Your Consultation\nPlease call\n(207) 885-1290\nto book a consultation.\nDo you think your pet may have ingested something poisonous? Please call the ASPCA Animal Poison Control Center at\n888-426-4435\n.\nNote:\nA consultation fee may apply.\nContact Maine Veterinary Medical Center\nWe would love to hear from you! You can complete the below form for general questions or comments.\n\nAddress\n1500 Technology Way\nScarborough, ME 04074\n\nPhone\n207-885-1290\n\nEmail\nreception@mvmc.vet\n\nHours\nOpen 24/7\nName\n*\nFirst\nLast\nEmail\n*\nPhone\nHow can we help you?\n*\nEmail\nSubmit\nGet Updates From Maine Veterinary Medical Center\nSign up for our newsletter using the form below.\nName\n*\nFirst\nLast\nHospital Name\nEmail\n*\nWhat's your area of interest at MVMC?\n*\nWhat's your area of interest at MVMC?\nClient events and resources\nVeterinarian events and resources\nHospital newsletter and updates\nEmployment opportunities\nOther\nSubmit\n© 2026 Maine Veterinary Medical Center |\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nPowered by PetDesk\nFollow\nFollow\nFollow",
